    },
    "開啟後，出示會員卡前需通過 %@。會員卡是身分憑證，這可以避免手機在解鎖狀態下被他人取用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, showing the card requires %@. The card is an identity credential, so this covers a phone handed over while already unlocked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
