    "登出只會清除這支手機上的憑證。因為登入與 Safari 共用工作階段，下次登入可能不需要重新輸入密碼。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signing out only clears credentials on this phone. Because sign-in shares a session with Safari, you may not need to enter your password again next time."
          }
        }
